1 city, town, abode of men Gen 4:17 (J) and often; גְּדֹלָה 10:12 (J), +, or קְטַנָּה Eccl 9:14 (compare Gen 19:20 ); especially a. fortified: בְּצֻרוֺת עָרִים 2Sam 20:6 +, etc., see מִבְצָר בָּצַר, ; מִבְצַרצֹֿר עִיר Josh 19:29 (P) fortified city (of) Tyre , ׳ע מָצוֺר Psa 31:22 +, etc., see מְצוּרָה מָצוֺר, below צוּר ( Micah 7:12 see מָצוֺר ); ׳ע עָזלָֿנוּ Isa 26:1 , מָעוּזּוֺ עָרֵי 17:9 ; ׳ְ וּבְרִיחַ דְּלָתַיִם 1Sam 23:7 ; ׳ע חוֺמָה Lev 25:29 , compare 25:30 (P), 1Kin 4:13 ; on Hosea 10:14 see I. עַם 2b ( 1Sam 9:14 read ᵐ5 הַשֵּׁעַר We Dr and others). b. opposed to הַמְּרָזִי כֹּפֶר 1Sam 6:18 , הַמּ ׳עָרֵי Deut 3:5 , ׳ע הַמְּרָזוֺת Est 9:19 ; distinguished from dependencies חֲצֵרִים Josh 13:23 +? c. עָרֶיה are dependent towns Josh 13:17 (P), Jer 19:15 . d. הַמַּמְלָכָה עָרֵי Josh 10:2 (JE) royal cities (i.e. with a king, compare Tel Amarna al šarri ), so singular 1Sam 27:5 , opposed to עָרֵי הַשָּׁדֶה 27:5 rural towns ; ׳ע הַמְּלוּכָה 2Sam 12:26 (but read ׳ע הַמַּיִם We Bu Kit Löhr HPS, see 2 below). e. מִסְכְּנוֺת עֶרֵי Exod 1:11 storage-cities , so 1Kin 9:19 2Chr 8:6 , 4 ; 17:12 ; for ׳מ ׳ע נַפְתָּלִי 16:4 read probably עֵלוֿגו ׳כִּנְרוֺת (as 1Kin 15:20 ; Be Kit Buhl); compare ׳ע הֶרֶכֶב 9:19 ; 10:26 2Chr 8:6 ; 9:25 ; 1:14 ; ׳ע הַמָּרָשִׁים 1Kin 9:19 2Chr 8:6 . f. ׳ע (הַ)מִקְלָט (P) asylum-cities Num 35:11 , 13 , 14 ; Josh 20:2 , compare Num 35:25-26 , 27 , 28 , 32 , ׳ע לְמִקְלָט 35:12 ; ׳ע הָרֹצֵחַ מִקְלַט Josh 21:13 + 4t. 21. g. ׳ע (הָ)אֱלֹהִים = Jerusalem: Psa 46:5 ; 87:3 , compare 48:2 ; 48:9 ; ׳ע ׳י Isa 60:14 ; Psa 101:8 ; ׳ע ׳י צְבָאוֺת 48:9 . h. city = inhabitants 1Sam 4:13 ; 5:12 ; Isa 22:2 ; Ruth 1:19 , so 2Sam 20:22 (reading הָעִיר for הָעָם ᵑ0 ) ᵐ5 We Dr and others (compare also following). i. combinations are: ׳ע רֹכְלִים Ezek 17:4 city of merchants ; ׳ע מוֺשָׁב Psa 107:4 ; 107:7 ; 107:36 city for dwelling ; especially of character or condition: ׳ע הַצֶּדֶק Isa 1:26 , הָאֱמֶת ׳ע Zech 8:3 ; ׳ע הַקּדֶשׁ Isa 48:2 ; 52:1 ; Neh 11:1 , 18 , compare Dan 9:24 , all of Jerusalem; קָדְשֶׁ֑ךָ עָרֵי Jer 5:17 of Judaean cities; of foreign cities, ׳ע תְּהִלָּךְ 49:25 , הַהֻלָּלה ׳הָע Ezek 26:17 , ׳הָע הָעַלִּיזָה Zeph 2:15 ; of Jerusalem also ׳הָע הַיּוֺנָה 3:1 oppressive city , ׳ע (הַ)דָּמִים bloody city Ezek 22:2 ; 24:6 , 9 and (of Nineveh) Nahum 3:1 . 2 of fortress in a city especially דָּוִד עִיר 2Sam 5:7 , 9 ; 6:10 + often (see דָּוִד ); ׳ע הַבָּ֑עַל כֵית 2Kin 10:25 (crpt; Klo proposes דְּבִיר for ׳ע , compare Kmp Benz Kit); ׳ע הַמַּיִם 2Sam 12:27 (so read also 12:26 , see 1d ). 3 apparently fortified place, of any size , עַדֿ נוֺצְרִים מִמִּגְּדַּל בְּכָלעָֿרֵיהֶם מִבְצָר עִיר 2Kin 17:9 18:8 ; compare Num 13:9 (P; but on compare of ver. see Di); perhaps also ׳ע עֲמָלֵק 1Sam 15:5 (HPS). — Hosea 7:4 see עור Hiph`il הַהֶרֶס עִיר see הֶרֶס .","rootNote":"or (in the plural) עָר ; or עָיַר ; (Judges 10:4), from 5782","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 43","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 43","1Chr 1 46","1Chr 1 50","1Chr 2 22","1Chr 2 23","1Chr 4 31","1Chr 4 32","1Chr 4 33"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":1095,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 43","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עִיר֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 46","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":46,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עִיר֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 50","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":50,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עִיר֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָרִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עִ֑יר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָרֵ